\newlabel{fig:ea}{{5}{12}{EA Phase~1 vs.\ standard Phase~1---RF test PK-only accuracy for four non-ceiling tasks (all 3-seed means, train model). GS is the primary beneficiary ($+6.0$\,pp), eliminating Phase~2 case studies entirely. CJ shows a consistent $+5.4$\,pp PK improvement; Snarks and DQ are within noise ($-0.9$\,pp and $0.0$\,pp respectively)}{figure.caption.30}{}}
