\newlabel{tab:seed_detail}{{10}{22}{Per-seed RF accuracy for the two key comparisons (GS PK-only; CJ full). All values are test-set RF accuracy (\%). v3: standard Phase~1. EA: evolutionary Phase~1. E3: oracle-free (both phases)}{table.caption.50}{}}
